<title>USA: Westell Technologies realigns management.</title>
<headline>Westell Technologies realigns management.</headline>
<dateline>AURURA, Ill. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westell Technologies Inc said Friday it promoted Rob Faw to the position of chief executive officer for its Westell Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>That position previously was held by Gary Seamans, who continues as chairman and chief executive of Westell Technologies. Stephen Hawrysz continues as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Faw has been an executive officer of Westell Technologies since July, 1995.</p>
<p>The company also said J.W. Nelson takes on the title of president of Westell Inc. He previously was co-president with Faw. Westell provides telecommunications products and services.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
